<title>YEMEN: Yemen central bank to issue new 500 rial note.</title>
<headline>Yemen central bank to issue new 500 rial note.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bank of Yemen said on Monday it would introduce a new 500 rial note into circulation on February 15.</p>
<p>Currently, the biggest denomination note in circulation is for 200 rials, which was introduced early last year.</p>
<p>($1=124 rials)</p>
</text>
